Rookie.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:36.270
Amick.

00:13:36.270 --> 00:13:37.140
34.

00:13:37.140 --> 00:13:38.310
Rookie.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.220
Boyd.

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:40.450
32.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.540
Fourth year.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:42.450
Bettenhausen.

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.560
42.

